# Base_Building_Design — Skeleton

## 1. Applies when
Construction/territory games (survival_crafting).

## 2. This document owns
- Building piece catalogue: structural rules, snap/physics constraints, support requirements.
- Base systems: power/delivery wiring, defense placement rules, decay/raid policies.
- Placement governance: where building is allowed/forbidden and why.

## 3. This document does NOT own
- Material economy of building — Resource_And_Economy.
- Crafted furniture functions — Crafting/Item docs.
- World zones where bases exist — World_Design (supplies rules).

## 4. Recommended chapter structure
1. Building philosophy / 2. Piece catalogue / 3. Structural rules / 4. Base systems / 5. Defense / 6. Decay & raid / 7. Placement governance / 8. Open questions

## 5. Common boundaries
- Base vs World: build rules here; world zones constrain placement via linked rules.
- Defense stats live here only if no separate balance doc; else linked.

## 6. Common audit rules
- Every piece declares support/attachment class.
- Placement forbidden-zone list mirrors World's zone rules (no drift).
